From 2b6beccaa267a1dd5d0e7176b06221510e64cd57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yndu13 <33746446+yndu13@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 08:26:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tests: start mock HTTP servers before sending requests

Use httptest.NewServer to open a listener before returning its endpoint.
This avoids racing ListenAndServe and uses an available port instead of
fixed ports 9001-9009. Close each server when its test finishes.

Partial backport of a45526d7f336ce14fce4dad9f01fe6de4bda2f73
("feat: support error detail && retry for throttling (#274)").
Retain only the mock-server changes for the nine tests present in v2.0.4
and remove the now-unused time import. The throttling changes are omitted.

Source: https://github.com/alibabacloud-go/darabonba-openapi/commit/a45526d7f336ce14fce4dad9f01fe6de4bda2f73
---
 client/client_test.go | 107 ++++++++++++++----------------------------
 1 file changed, 34 insertions(+), 73 deletions(-)

